  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b53d3a7811bb8498d9ae0485fd422ad9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Day3_Legit_Room
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: DontCallMe::DontCallMe.Data.RoomContent
  newspaper:
    masthead: SEOUL DAILY
    issue: No. 12,410
    dateLine: THURSDAY, OCTOBER 8, 2026
    price: 1,000 won
    headline: Fake "landlord's son" calls tenants on rent day
    subhead: The landlord was at home all along. Tenants who checked their lease
      kept their rent.
    photo: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 4c63c0d2cf38942db834f06de02c655f, type: 3}
    caption: 'Before any transfer, the bank shows who really gets the money. Photo:
      Seoul Daily'
    body:
    - A man claiming to be the son of a Mangwon-dong landlord phoned tenants on rent
      day yesterday. His father was in hospital, he said, and this month's rent should
      go to a new account before 5 p.m.
    - 'The real landlord, Choi Youngsik, 71, was not in hospital: he spent the afternoon
      organising a water tank cleaning. "My son''s number is in every lease," he
      said. "And the rent account only changes when I write it down."'
    - Police say the account the caller gave, Hanbit Bank 620-118-449027, belongs
      to a woman who sold her bank book online. Anyone called by 010-4127-8830 should
      report it to 112.
    warningTitle: 'PARCEL CALLS: CHECK WHO IS ASKING'
    warningText: 'Fake "unpaid duty" calls now quote real orders. A new number or
      account has no reports yet, so compare: does the number belong to your courier?
      Is the account in the courier''s name? And what does the courier''s own notice
      say?'
    print: {fileID: 0}
    local:
    - title: AliStar data leak
      text: AliStar says the names, phone numbers and recent orders of some Korean
        customers were exposed last month. No card details were taken, the company
        says.
    - title: Water tank cleaning today
      text: Villas on Poeun-ro are without water from 10:00 to 12:00.
    - title: Mangwon market by night
      text: Open until 23:00 on Saturday, with street food and live music.
    ads:
    - title: "\uCE58\uD0A8 CHICKEN 24H"
      text: Crispy & soy garlic. Free delivery over 20,000 won. 02-555-0147
    - title: CHECKFIRST.KR
      text: Who owns that number? Whose account is it? Look it up before you send.
    - title: HANBIT ACADEMY
      text: TOEIC weekend class, 30% off for students. 02-555-0166
  drawer:
  - title: "Lease contract \xB7 Unit 302"
    kind: 0
    issuer: Mangwon Heights
    fields:
    - label: Landlord
      value: Choi Youngsik
      isFact: 0
      factKind: 6
    - label: Landlord's phone
      value: 010-5512-3380
      isFact: 1
      factKind: 0
    - label: Rent
      value: 450,000 won a month, due on the 7th
      isFact: 0
      factKind: 6
    - label: Rent account
      value: 110-771-209944
      isFact: 1
      factKind: 1
    - label: Account holder
      value: Choi Youngsik (Nuri Bank)
      isFact: 0
      factKind: 6
    - label: If absent, contact
      value: Choi Hyunwoo (son)
      isFact: 0
      factKind: 6
    - label: Son's phone
      value: 010-2280-6614
      isFact: 1
      factKind: 0
    body: 'Special terms

      1. The rent account changes only with a written notice
      from the landlord.

      2. The tenant allows the annual gas safety inspection.

      3.
      No smoking inside the unit.'
    stamp: 
    image: {fileID: 0}
  - title: "Gas bill \xB7 September"
    kind: 1
    issuer: Mapo City Gas
    fields:
    - label: Customer
      value: "Kim Jiwoo \xB7 Mangwon Heights 302"
      isFact: 0
